# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  CineAura — English language file
#  The English text on the left is the key, and English is the default language, so every value here equals its key.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Format: English = translation
#  Lines starting with # are comments and are ignored.
#  A value that is missing falls back to the English key.
#  A key that contains = is escaped with \= (see the playlist placeholder below).


